Z||000000||Fiero*101||09-14-2001||04:14 PM||||Ok Im in a bit of a jam I think.<BR>I bought my car w/ a bra but it wasnt on well i wasnt thinking of putting it on so i thought well ill sell it. Ok Sqouch wants to buy my bra but as im looking at it getting ready to package it to send it to him i find out that its for a PONTIAC 82-84 TRANS AM OR FIREBIRD <BR>Now im guessing that this bra will not work on his Fiero am I right?<P>any info is good info  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Fiero*101||||reg||1
